+// Patch 64 (GitHub #193 #201): Gears 3 (and 2) mount the DLC at start-up one package at a time - an overlapped
+// XEnumerate of one item, then an overlapped XamContentCreate of it - and every step waited the deferred queue's
+// artificial 100 ms before it completed (~0.23 s a package, ~2.8 s for 12). When the title's checkpoint load started
+// inside that window, the title ran it after the package in flight and never asked for the rest (SG2_0 instead of
+// SG13_0) until the main menu. DLC steps now complete without the delay, still deferred and in queue order.
+REXCVAR_DEFINE_BOOL(cogbox_dlc_fast_complete, true, "Kernel",
+                    "Patch 64: DLC (marketplace content) enumerate / open steps complete without the 100 ms deferred "
+                    "delay, so all DLC mounts before the checkpoint load (GitHub #193 #201)");
 
